 course builds upon the differential calculus covered in Calculus I , providing in-depth coverage of integral calculus including integration techniques, applications of integration. Advanced topics such as series convergence tests, Taylor series, calculus with parametric and polar equations, and introductory differential equations are also covered. This comprehensive course will prepare students for further studies in advanced mathematics, engineering, statistics, machine learning, and other fields requiring a solid foundation in integral calculus." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1009 "Further your understanding of calculus: master advanced integration techniques, model real-world situations using differential equations, and more." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1012 106 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1013 "CA2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1014 #uuid "4965f9cc-fd21-5d50-b441-6e80983b17dd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048669 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049363 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049927 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049931 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050551 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186068739 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186068740 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186068741 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186068742 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1031 "Factoring Cubic Expressions by Grouping" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1033 428 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048272 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "8e849294-9d3d-5482-b7b2-842caeed27c9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048489 #edb/ref 10